From 538db476c75ae8ff8f6491d218dbdee169e26df6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Payam Mirzaei <payam.mirzaei@arena2036.de>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:48:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(BE-293): safe checklist retrigger (DID validation,
 IdentityHub wallet, BPNL 409)

- applicationRequestApiSlice: map RETRIGGER_VALIDATE_DID_DOCUMENT ->
  retrigger-validate-did and RETRIGGER_CREATE_IDENTITY_HUB_WALLET ->
  retrigger-create-identity-hub-wallet; resolve endpoints from own properties
  only; retriggerProcess calls known endpoints only (a missing mapping used
  to POST .../application/{id}/undefined).
- ProgressVerificationButton: offer retrigger only for FAILED entries; one
  explicit action per retriggerable step (never several submitted at once);
  synchronous guard against duplicate submissions; async/await with
  try/catch/finally so loading always resets; 409 and other errors shown
  as actionable messages, never retried; checklist refreshed afterwards.
  Loading was previously set to the error title (a truthy string), leaving
  an endless spinner.
- Tests: endpoint mapping, unknown steps, exactly one POST to
  retrigger-validate-did, status guards, double-click, 409, loading cleanup.
- jest: resolve tsconfig baseUrl imports and stub style imports.
